{"dest": "ngorongoro", "text": "The Ngorongoro Crater offers one of the best chances in Tanzania to see black rhino, alongside lions, buffalo, elephants and abundant plains game within a single, spectacular volcanic caldera."},
{"dest": "tarangire", "text": "Tarangire is famous for large elephant herds among ancient baobabs, especially in the dry season, with lions and buffalo often found near the river that gives the park its life."},
{"dest": "manyara", "text": "Lake Manyara's groundwater forest and lakeshore make a lovely contrast, with elephants, buffalo and baboons, and a long-standing reputation for lions that sometimes rest in trees."}
