{"q": "Which part of the itinerary works best for ballooning?", "a": "We usually recommend scheduling your flight on a morning when you have at least two nights in the same area of the Serengeti. This avoids a long transfer straight after landing and gives some flexibility if conditions are unsuitable on the first attempt. It also lets you enjoy the full experience, from the quiet dawn launch to the leisurely breakfast afterwards."}
