{"dest": "ngorongoro", "text": "The Ngorongoro Crater packs remarkable wildlife into a compact area, so families can see a great variety of animals without spending too long in the vehicle."},
{"dest": "serengeti", "text": "The Serengeti offers the full safari spectacle, with big cats and vast herds, and is best enjoyed with at least two nights to avoid long consecutive drives."},
{"dest": "zanzibar", "text": "Zanzibar is a relaxing finale, with warm, calm waters on many beaches, cultural discoveries in the lanes of Stone Town and plenty of time for family downtime together."}
