{"q": "When is the best time for a honeymoon safari?", "a": "Tanzania can be visited year-round. The long dry season, roughly June to October, is popular for wildlife viewing and coincides with the Mara River crossings. The months from January to March bring the calving season in the southern Serengeti and generally good beach weather on Zanzibar. We will help you choose dates around your wedding."}
