{"dest": "serengeti", "text": "The Central Serengeti offers classic plains, granite kopjes and acacia scenery, with excellent big cat photography year-round and wonderfully dramatic skies during the transitional seasons."},
{"dest": "mara", "text": "From around July to early October, the Mara River crossings provide unrivalled drama for photographers willing to wait patiently on the bank for the herds to commit."},
{"dest": "tarangire", "text": "Tarangire's elephants, baobabs and golden dry-season light make for distinctive, characterful compositions that feel quite different from the wide open grass plains of the Serengeti."}
